#
# Verible lint rules for make lint, --rules_config: Verible's defaults, but
# - parameters and localparams: ALL_CAPS, as the CC_SERDES ports and
#   registers are named (RX_BUF_CFG_ADDR, PLL_CFG0_ADDR), or CamelCase
# - no line limit: port lists, register tables and report formats run past
#   100 columns, and the files are not run through verible-verilog-format
# - tasks and functions in a module are static by default (IEEE 1800-2023
#   13.3.1); writing "static" adds nothing
parameter-name-style=parameter_style:ALL_CAPS|CamelCase;localparam_style:ALL_CAPS|CamelCase
-line-length
-explicit-task-lifetime
-explicit-function-lifetime
